---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About - CxRomos, LLC">
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="About"
    title="CxRomos, LLC is a founder-led software company focused on operational intelligence."
    description="The company is led by Danijel Kecman, a software engineer and systems builder with 20+ years across mobile, enterprise platforms, aerospace, financial systems, real-time platforms, UX, cloud, and product architecture."
  />

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 md:py-20 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
      <section class="panel ticks">
        <header class="panel-head">
          <span class="mono text-faint">01</span>
          <span class="mono text-signal">rationale</span>
        </header>
        <div class="p-7 leading-8 text-muted">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-bright">Why this company exists</h2>
          <p class="mt-4">Most operational software shows data. Very little of it helps teams make better decisions when the context is incomplete, moving quickly, and expensive to misread.</p>
          <p class="mt-4">CxRomos, LLC focuses on the layer between raw data and human judgment: satellite and geospatial intelligence, OSINT and market evidence, financial risk, sensor telemetry, edge systems, and interfaces that compress complexity.</p>
          <p class="mt-4">The underlying belief is simple: automation starts in the mind, not the machine. Software only amplifies the thinking behind it - so the work begins by making the decision logic explicit, then building systems that extend it.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="panel ticks">
        <header class="panel-head">
          <span class="mono text-faint">02</span>
          <span class="mono text-signal">founder</span>
        </header>
        <div class="p-7 leading-8 text-muted">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-bright">Founder profile</h2>
          <p class="mt-4">Danijel’s background spans mobile engineering, banking applications, real-time platforms, cloud infrastructure, IoT and edge devices, enterprise applications, system design, and product strategy.</p>
          <p class="mt-4">The current focus is aerospace and satellite intelligence, OSINT, risk and financial systems, market monitoring, telemetry, and decision infrastructure for connected operations.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
